  "text": "## PART 2: Current Account  \n### Product Overview  \n**What It Is:**\nA checking account for everyday spending with standing orders, Direct Debits, and optional overdraft.  \n**Who It's For:**\n- Customers who need a primary bank account\n- People who pay bills regularly\n- Anyone who wants to combine savings + checking  \n**Key Benefit:**\nAll-in-one account for daily banking with no monthly fees.",
